#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-location-entry.c:126
msgid "Search cities"
msgstr "Cerca citates"

#. Recurse, adding the ADM1 name to the country name
#. Translators: this is the name of a location followed by a region, for example:
#. * 'London, United Kingdom'
#. * You shouldn't need to translate this string unless the language has a different comma.
#.
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-location-entry.c:567
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-location-entry.c:592
#, c-format
msgid "%s, %s"
msgstr "%s, %s"

#. Translators: "city, country"
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:282
#, c-format
msgctxt "timezone loc"
msgid "%s, %s"
msgstr "%s, %s"

#. Translators: UTC here means the Coordinated Universal Time.
#. * %:::z will be replaced by the offset from UTC e.g. UTC+02
#.
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:318
msgid "UTC%:::z"
msgstr "UTC%:::z"

#. Translators: This is the time format used in 12-hour mode.
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:322
msgid "%l:%M %p"
msgstr "%l:%M %p"

#. Translators: This is the time format used in 24-hour mode.
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:325
msgid "%R"
msgstr "%R"

#. Translators: "timezone (utc shift)"
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:328
#, c-format
msgctxt "timezone map"
msgid "%s (%s)"
msgstr "%s (%s)"

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:337
#, c-format
msgid "Current timezone: %s at %s; current time: %s"
msgstr "Fuso horari actual: %s a %s; hora actual: %s"

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.c:502
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.blp:17
msgid "Time Zone"
msgstr "Fuso horari"

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.blp:18
msgid ""
"The time zone will be set automatically if your location can be found. You "
"can also search for a city to set it yourself."
msgstr ""
"Le fuso horari essera definite automaticamente si tu localisation pote esser "
"trovate. Tu anque pote cercar un citate pro definir lo te mesme."

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/timezone/gis-timezone-page.blp:48
msgid "Please search for a nearby city"
msgstr "Cerca un citate vicin"

#. Translators: This is meant to be a warm, engaging welcome message,
#. * like greeting somebody at the door. If the exclamation mark is not
#. * suitable for this in your language you may replace it. The space
#. * before the exclamation mark in this string is a typographical thin
#. * space (U200a) to improve the spacing in the title, which you can
#. * keep or remove. The %s is getting replaced with the name and version
#. * of the OS, e.g. "GNOME 3.38"
#.
#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/welcome/gis-welcome-page.c:62
#, c-format
msgid "Welcome to %s !"
msgstr "Benvenite a %s !"

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/welcome/gis-welcome-page.blp:5
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/welcome/gis-welcome-page.blp:31
msgid ""
"Setup will guide you through making an account and enabling some features. "
"We’ll have you up and running in no time."
msgstr ""
"Configuration te guidara a facer un conto e activar alicun functionalitates. "
"Isto essera preste e in functionamiento in pauc tempore."

#: gnome-initial-setup/pages/welcome/gis-welcome-page.blp:35
msgid "_Start Setup"
msgstr "_Initiar le configuration"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:1
msgid "Force live user mode"
msgstr "Fortiar le modo de usator in vivo"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:2
msgid "Force OEM mode"
msgstr "Fortiar le modo OEM"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:3
msgid "Try or Install?"
msgstr "Essayar o installar?"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:4
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"You can try a temporary version of ${NAME} without making changes to the "
"computer. If you decide to install later, just launch the installer from the "
"Activities view.\n"
"\n"
"        Alternatively, choose install to launch the installer."
msgstr ""
"Tu pote essayar un version temporari de ${NAME} sin facer cambiamentos al "
"computator. Si tu decide installar lo depost, solmente lancea le installator "
"ab le vista de Activitates."

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:7
msgid "Install to Disk…"
msgstr "Installar a disco…"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:8
#, sh-format
msgid "Try ${NAME}"
msgstr "Essayar ${NAME}"

#: po/EXTRA_STRINGS.sh:9
#, sh-format
msgid "Install ${PRETTY_NAME}"
msgstr "Installar ${PRETTY_NAME}"

